===Etymology===
Compilation of the words {{m|non|álfr||elf}} and {{m|non|heim||home}} and comes from the Old Norse {{m|non|Álfheimr}}.

===Proper noun===
{{non-proper noun}}

# The home of the [[Ljósálfar]] ([[light elves]], [[álfar]], divine beings), located up in the sky.
# [[Elfland]].
# Possibly [[heaven]].

